"notes": "Cash basis, Saline County FY ending 2025-06-30. Receipts/disbursements from Statement of Cash Receipts, Disbursements, and Changes in Cash Basis Fund Balances - Governmental Funds, Total Governmental Funds column (p4); page numbers are within trimmed PDF (printed page 8 = trimmed p4). Beginning/ending cash are total cash basis fund balances; ending balance includes investments of 2,824,980 (cash and equivalents 5,562,260), so ending_investments left null to avoid double counting. Detail: General Fund recorded from the budgetary comparison schedule (p5-6) with taxes split using the General Fund column breakdown on p4 (budget_final given only on the combined Taxes line 8,752,517, so null on split items); major funds Road & Bridge, Inheritance and Highway Bridge Buyback from p7-8 (disbursements printed as a single line, function taken from p4); nonmajor funds' per-fund budget schedules (pp9-15) only show total receipts/disbursements so the more detailed combining statement Total Nonmajor column (p20) is used instead (16+ funds, so combined; per-fund columns on pp16-20 not itemized). No double counting between the budget schedules and the combining statement. Transfers on the General Fund detail are in other financing; transfers in and out each net to 10,582,454 across funds. No business-type funds; no balance sheet liabilities. Read pages 1-20 of 20"
}
